SUMMARY:Surreal Sirkus Arts Festival
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Asheville’s most bizarre celebration of the wonderful and weird things that make this community so unique! As always\, the event is free and open to all.\n\nWe’re back at Pack Square Park from noon until 10 pm on Saturday\, Oct. 24 with three stages of live music\, djs\, local art vendors\, food and libations\, weird performances of many varieties\, and of course\, as always the event culminates in a one-of a kind show by the Surreal Sirkus at sunset.\n\n\nMain Stage Schedule: \n12-12:45 G Bevin\n12:45-2 Dave Reyn (Ecstatic Dance Wave)\n2-3:15 Ixnee\n3:15-4:30 Rezonator (live Goa Trance)\n4:30-5:45 Mombi Yuleman\n5:45-6:30 Sorry About That\n6:30-6:45 Autumn in Altamont\n7-7:45 Circles Stars and Squares\n8-9 Surreal Sirkus\n9-10 Sensoma\n\n\n\nSecond Stage Schedule :\n\n12-1 Logos\n1-2 Jyde Hekel\n2-3 Taps\n3-4:30 Southron Rancor\n430-5 Emily Hay\n5-6:30 SoulForm\n6:30-7:30 The Nickel-Plated Angels\n7:30-7:50 Charlotte Smith
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/surreal-sirkus-arts-festival/
LOCATION:Pack Square Park
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,DJ/Electronic,Live Music
END:VEVENT
